%% Activity — student sign-up and join request (no UV ID claim, spec 24)
flowchart TD
  A([Start]) --> B[Open sign-up page]
  B --> C[/Enter any email + password<br/>and solve the CAPTCHA/]
  C --> D{CAPTCHA solved?}
  D -- No --> D1[Reject: complete the check] --> C
  D -- Yes --> E{Password ≥ 8 chars,<br/>letter + number?}
  E -- No --> E1[Show password rule] --> C
  E -- Yes --> F{Email already used?}
  F -- "Yes (same 'check your email' reply)" --> F1[Email the owner:<br/>you already have an account] --> Z1([End])
  F -- No --> G[Send verification link]
  G --> H{Link clicked?}
  H -- No --> H1[Cannot sign in yet] --> H
  H -- Yes --> I[Sign in — state claim_pending]
  I --> I1[/Optional: write UV ID on profile<br/>not checked, not unique/]
  I1 --> J[/Fill join form: name, dept,<br/>level, term, section, group?/]
  J --> K{Section has a CR?}
  K -- No --> K1[Section not listed — closed] --> J
  K -- Yes --> L{Already has an<br/>open request?}
  L -- Yes --> L1[Refuse: request already open] --> O
  L -- No --> N[Pending join request<br/>→ CR & DCRs of section<br/>or straight to admin if the student is a CR/DCR]
  N --> O[Student sees 'waiting for approval'<br/>can edit profile only]
  O --> P{CR/DCR acts<br/>within 3 days?}
  P -- No --> P1[Escalate to department admin] --> Q
  P -- Yes --> Q{Decision}
  Q -- "Reject (reason)" --> R[Email student: rejected] --> J
  Q -- "Accept / accept with<br/>corrected group" --> S[Account active,<br/>enrolment stamped with semester]
  S --> T[Add to section group chat]
  T --> U[Email student: accepted]
  U --> V[Dashboard with routine<br/>& live status]
  V --> W{Admin removes student<br/>from section?}
  W -- "Yes (reason, audited)" --> W1[Enrolment revoked,<br/>back to claim_pending] --> J
  W -- No --> Z2([End])
